      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-85963",
      ":question/problem": "Suppose we wish to study the population of students at a particular high school. If we choose $6$ students from the boys' basketball team, then which of the following are sources of bias in our sample?\n\n1. All the sampling units are boys.\n2. All the sampling units play basketball.\n3. All the sampling units attend the same school."
